Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?TS06-DRV=20rev=20B=20netlist=20and=20footpr?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ints:=20OV=20clamp,=20protection,=20=D0=9C=D0=9B=D0=A2-0,5,=20L?=
 =?UTF-8?q?1?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Netlist (driver board only):
* E1: an over-voltage clamp independent of U12 and the divider: 1N4762A +
  1N4762A + 1N4761A (239 V), 100k into a 2N3904 with 10k base-emitter,
  collector on PWM_G. Onset >= 225.2 V at every tolerance, full clamp
  <= 270.2 V; the tolerance table is in ts06pair.py.
* E5 1N5819 across U14; E8 1.5KE18A after F1; E11 1M on A6, 1k + 10 nF on
  D7 and D8 at J1 (J1 pins 5 and 6 now D7_J, D8_J).
* L1: Bourns 5900-221-RC, 220 uH, Isat 1.8 A, axial, lying.
* U13 on a male PLS-5 (TS06_PinHeader_1x05_DS3231), the module outlined.
* The 0.5 W resistors on TS06_R_Axial_MLT-0.5_P15.24mm; the decoders on an
  oval-pad socket (0.5 mm for lines threading between cathode pins); R65,
  R67-R71 standing; stale 28-pin text and the R62/R63 note fixed.
* OVZ_* is an HV net on this board only (HV_PATTERNS_DRV).

Footprints: the МЛТ-0,5 (1.1 mm holes, 15.24 mm), the axial choke, the
DS3231 header, the oval DIP-16; VT21 1.2 mm holes in 1.7 x 2.4 pads; J1
0.85 mm holes (JST: 0.70 +0.10/-0; Rezonit -0.13) in 1.3 x 1.8 pads; the
driver board's own footprints' silk at 0.15 mm, silk at pads dropped from
the library as the board writer drops it. BOMs regenerated.

